---
description: Code Quality Guidelines
globs: **/*.tsx, **/*.ts, src/**/*.ts, src/**/*.tsx
---

- Use `React.SyntheticEvent<HTMLFormElement>` in place of `React.FormEvent<HTMLFormElement>` and similar uses.
- Never use window.alert, window.confirm, or window.prompt. Use the modal components instead.
- Prefer
    ```
    if (isEditing && editId) {
      onEdit(editId, { start: fullStart, end: fullEnd, homeBase, timezone });
    } else {
      onAdd({ start: fullStart, end: fullEnd, homeBase, timezone });
    }
    ```
    over
    ```
    if (isEditing && editId)onEdit(editId, { start: fullStart, end: fullEnd, homeBase, timezone });
    else onAdd({ start: fullStart, end: fullEnd, homeBase, timezone });
    ```
